![](/media/englishos/mute-english/01/01.png)![](/media/englishos/mute-english/01/02.png)

Many people can answer simple English questions.\
The difficulty starts when the prepared answer runs out.

EnglishOS is exploring a different problem: not how to learn more English, but how to use the English you already know to keep a conversation going — and eventually get to know another person.
